//     CloseSpanWithinBudget postcondition: insideOut ==> parser.IsValidPrefix(currentOut). ✓
//
//   (!insideConstrainedOut branch):
//     Implication vacuous. We only flip insideConstrainedOut to true on
//     RenderedEndsWith(generated, "<<"), setting currentConstrainedOut := [] which
//     satisfies IsValidPrefix([]) by method precondition. ✓
